  51           * void CPU_Init(void)
  52           * Purpose : This function initializes CPU Core for the whole system operation.
  53           *           AX120xx supports 2 clock rates of 25MHz and 100MHz.
  54           *           The Program Wait State and Data Stretch Cycle are configured via
  55           *           different clock rates and the Memory Shadow Mode as below table,
  56           *           the range of both the Program Wait State and the Data Stretch Cycle are 0 ~7.
  57           *           All external interrupts are disabled during system initialization.
  58           * Params  : None
  59           * Returns : None
  60           * Note    : None
  61           *--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  62           */
